Or my favorite method, find a safe place (i.e. a locked room) with a
fountain, dig down with a pickaxe on the fountain, drop everything that
can rust/blank/etc except the scrolls you want to blank and the potions
you want to turn into water, and jump into the pools of water that
resulted from digging down with a pickaxe. Guaranteed source of
near-unlimited potions of water relatively early on. Really depletes
your energy if you have teleportitis, though, regardless of whether or
not you're on a no-teleport level (Not to mention it's really risky
with teleportitis and no teleport control on a level that isn't no
teleport).

As for making holy water, a much easier way is just to drop a pile of
water onto a coaligned altar and praying.



